 "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "890547815531463"}]}, "change_log": "The Rift Gameplay\n\t*Updated the drone hunt and time trial activities (all variants) to now have enemies\n\nParts\n\t*Added 4 new utility parts available to everyone automatically with new gameplay functionality (decoupler, drone S, drone M, drone L)\n\nProgression Updates\n\t*Added new 4 new objectives under Tier 3 as Path 5\n\t*Objectives unlock 4 new paints\n\t*All objective rewards updated to now reward XP\n\nStore\n\t*2 New Paints added to store\n\t*2 New Halloween Avatars added to store\n\nLeaderboards\n\t*Reset Rift activity leaderboards due to activity changes\n\nQoL Improvements\n\t*Sprint option added\n\nOther Fixes\n\t*Fixed test option issues\n\t*Fixed voice chat inconsistencies\n\t*Multiple LIV Camera Fixes\n\t*Multiple Performance Improvements\n\nOther\n\t*Technical Improvements\n\t*General improvements and bug fixes", "created_date": 1793107746, "id": "29999334372999665", "version": "0.12.0", "version_code": 22557, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "29999328279666941"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "6784970791529351", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29999334372999665"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1793049448, "id": "29990113127255123", "version": "0.12.0", "version_code": 22555, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "29990107430589026"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBi